Joule Local v0.1
Independent Android controller for the original ChefSteps Joule.

Protocol encoding and BLE behavior are derived from:
https://github.com/acato/ha-joule
Commit: 4c950a68d22b059be09fb681afa83339408da6d0
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (licenses/Apache-2.0.txt).
The upstream files were translated and adapted to Java / Android.

Modifications include native Android GATT operation serialization,
message-handle correlation, explicit acknowledgement checks, local private
pairing-key storage, a phone reminder timer, and an e-ink friendly UI.

